    "updated_at": "2023-05-31T15:49:20Z",
    "body": "Initial testing:\r\n\r\n- Google Translate skips CODE, KBD, and VAR, but not SAMP.\r\n- Yandex Translate skips CODE, KBD, VAR, and SAMP.\r\n\r\nTested using English->French on the following code snippet:\r\n\r\n```\r\n<p>The <code>letter-spacing</code> property handles tracking (spacing) between letters.\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote: Replacing CODE with SPAN results in translation of “letter-spacing”, so this functions as an effective control.\r\n",
